      "content": "2.1 Physiographic Divisions"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "The physical geography of Odisha is categorized primarily into physiographic divisions and soil characteristics.",
        "The major physiographic divisions include the Northern Plateau, Eastern Ghats, and Coastal Plains.",
        "Soil analysis forms a fundamental section of Odisha's physical geographical study."
      ],
      "id": "015v8d5"
    },
