      "content": "2.1.3 Coastal Plains"
    },
    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Frequently tested topics include distinguishing the features of the Northern Plateau, Eastern Ghats, and Coastal Plains.",
        "Questions often examine soil types and their specific spatial distribution across Odisha."
      ],
      "id": "7n658pn"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "nlwy3q9",
      "content": "The coastal plain extends along the Bay of Bengal for about 480 km. It includes the Mahanadi delta (one of largest deltas in India), Chilika Lake (largest lagoon in Asia), and the Rushikulya coastline in the south. Olive Ridley sea turtles nest at Gahirmatha, Rushikulya, and Devi Mouth."
    },
